        <activityName xml:lang="en">Charger, for electric passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Charger, for electric passenger car
This dataset describes a charger used for charging the Li-Ion battery of an electric passenger car. It is based on direct information from the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. The entries are given as a function of kg device. The specific charger which was used for this dataset weights 6.2 kg.;
UUID: 0bcb4455-be14-3db5-82f4-59254b61884f
&lt;null&gt;
Location: Unspecified
Technology: This dataset is based on current, high-level standard.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 55800 kg
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Data on materials and technology has been provided directly by the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0bcb4455-be14-3db5-82f4-59254b61884f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
